@CLIENT_NAME@
@WEBUI_README_RULE@

@CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-app.exe is the node of @CLIENT_NAME@, its wallet and its interface in one
program; the interface is shown by Microsoft Edge WebView2, which Windows 10 and
11 have. Without it, install the WebView2 Runtime (Evergreen) from
https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/

Setup
-----
Unpack the files into a folder and run @CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-app.exe (or use the installer).
The node and its wallets keep their data in %APPDATA%\@CLIENT_NAME@;
the settings of the app are in %APPDATA%\@CLIENT_NAME@\@CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-app.json.

The programs without an interface (@CLIENT_BIN_NAME@d, @CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-cli, @CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-tx,
@CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-wallet, @CLIENT_BIN_NAME@-util) are in the daemon folder.

